; Axis A (cross-ref name indexing) — positive direction.
;
; The `(phrase)` instance omits `:name`, so its defaulted symbol
; `origin` never appears as an author kvpair. With axis A off the
; pre-pass `buildCrossRefIndexForest` skips that instance entirely;
; the registry stays empty, and the author-written `[origin]` ref
; fails registry lookup -> `not_cross_ref` at the typed-vector slot.
; With axis A on the pre-pass consults the overlay, registers
; `origin`, and the author's ref resolves silently.
;
; `expected.sjon` matches the axis-off baseline (one `not_cross_ref`).
(plugin :name probe :version "1.0.0"
  (value-kind :name phrase-name
    :underlying symbol
    :cross-ref (cross-ref :target phrase))
  (value-kind :name phrase-name-list
    :underlying vector
    :vector (vector-shape :element phrase-name))
  (form :name phrase
    (key :name name :type symbol :default origin :optional false))
  (form :name track
    (key :name sequence :type phrase-name-list :optional false)))

(phrase)
(track :sequence [origin])
